  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.body.003a78b57239": "A barged-in exchange pad where independent ice crews and the Shoal Claim settle on one",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.body.03f33e8705fe": "Free surveyors moored this platform to triangulate the Resonance Obelisk through the",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.body.0c85d3850af5": "An independent family freehold in the one sector where ownership is a rumor the Reach",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.body.2e8c3b76e6f9": "A Quiet cutting front on the march\\u2019s black ice, glass-sheared rock sold at the",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.body.35c51145ddba": "A corner-lot prospect staked off the Cinder Claim, worked until a radiation flare",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.body.3d0d4cb9dd0e": "A salvage hold filed straight down the Void-Reach\\u2019s debris scar, worked by crews",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.body.3ed8f5e63f38": "Leased by Forge Foundry as a slag-kill: reject alloy fused here and tipped over the",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.body.46cc39a06d76": "The cut\\u2019s first anchorage: tie-up rings, an assay scale, bunks for four crews.",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.body.84fb3f9bcfb3": "A chartered staging berth on the southern freight lane, where convoys formed up before",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.body.9c1d9bb169d8": "Charon\\u2019s deep-belt intake town: conveyor barges, family bunks, a school roster",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.body.cb88e8a6e14c": "The registry lists eight earlier stakes on this body, each lapsed for unpaid fees.",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.body.d2fc84524e54": "A plinth on the dark rim where far-rim captains file claims the registries won\\u2019t",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.body.e033d077f13e": "A DMC survey stake from the first belt rush, re-flagged when Ceres Refinery opened",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.body.e639a35abbd1": "A Free collective built the seamed moon out as a full extraction floor: hab ring, ore",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.body.e9466ddda888": "A Vael salvage stake on the highest rock in the Reach, filed to stage vault recovery",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.desc.12fd7c084015": "Fabricates a permanent acceleration ring and nav relay on the clear line to this claim’s linked station. Travel Burn is amplified only while the ship remains inside that physical corridor.",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.desc.285ed5f73a7f": "Automated turret that protects the body from raids. Required on dangerous frontier claims.",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.desc.2b701c74fca8": "Runs the fitted battery as a garrison. Warns of raids on your claims in this sector and contests them with stationed guns. Highest upkeep; produces nothing.",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.desc.55f3c82f7f16": "Auto-refines raw ore into materials at a fixed rate, no station visit needed. Lighter, dearer goods to ship.",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.desc.72ee331c6bd2": "Runs the fitted refinery as a working site. Deliver raw ore here; crews process it into refined goods you haul out. Stocked sites draw raiders in low-security space.",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.desc.82bd0b7e236a": "Runs the fitted depot as a freight relay. Deposit goods; scheduled convoys haul them to the linked station and sell at the local market price less the relay fee. Convoys risk piracy in low-security space.",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.desc.ad7c24a20084": "Links this body to a chosen station. Collapses your worst lane to a single jump — classic automation that rewrites the map.",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.desc.b4719cabddda": "A dropoff point for your drones. Drones assigned a depot template route here. Stores overflow ore.",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.desc.ed653dbc9994": "Extends discovery pulses to hidden POIs across this claim’s sector and files one free local rumor card per sector-day. It does not reveal exact positions or widen combat contact scans.",
  "loc.src.data.claimablebodies.field.name.01642dc73cfc": "Sensor Post",
