  "loc.src.data.enemies.field.hint.051c52486e35": "BOW",
  "loc.src.data.enemies.field.hint.2f77f98496d8": "The sacs hang off her stern. Cross the lunge and work her back.",
  "loc.src.data.enemies.field.label.40e296065f0e": "PROW RIB",
  "loc.src.data.enemies.field.label.4a47f47620a0": "BROOD SAC",
  "loc.src.data.enemies.field.line.06881dff96a9": "A hold full of something worth hauling. Pressed, it burns for the lane.",
  "loc.src.data.enemies.field.line.13ef3d76f84d": "Iron Maw is rolling broadside. Cross its bow before the batteries align.",
  "loc.src.data.enemies.field.line.17f9360c1370": "The Choir shields its marked own — the zealot bodies the lane to the ward.",
  "loc.src.data.enemies.field.line.2e8f0306ac9b": "Ghost already has the shot.",
  "loc.src.data.enemies.field.line.34625f439d28": "Foreman committing. Mirror prow sheds head-on fire — cross its charge and work the stern.",
  "loc.src.data.enemies.field.line.3512e35fdfde": "Forge Regent takes the furnace. Mirror crown wider than the Foreman — cross the pass and work the stern.",
  "loc.src.data.enemies.field.line.3db7b99878e7": "Fuse burning. That dart is a flying bomb — shove it, sling it, or put it down before it arrives.",
  "loc.src.data.enemies.field.line.3eaa5533cdba": "Customs sweep resolving. Answer it clean or the plated prow comes aboard.",
  "loc.src.data.enemies.field.line.46a2686628a5": "Anchor field winding. Break radius or move the hull.",
  "loc.src.data.enemies.field.line.68520108e0ee": "Interceptor squaring its plated prow for pursuit. Cross the pass and work the stern.",
  "loc.src.data.enemies.field.line.7914bae0d9df": "Wake is salted. Turn now or fly through our work.",
  "loc.src.data.enemies.field.line.90b75c75775b": "The ace is lining a pass. Throw mass at it — do not chase its guns.",
  "loc.src.data.enemies.field.line.97a2336d4118": "The broodmother floods the room. Her sacs are the weak points — her own brood is ammunition.",
  "loc.src.data.enemies.field.line.bcf532aabddb": "Enemy Massline spooling. Displace, break anchor, or outmass it.",
  "loc.src.data.enemies.field.line.ca963966b121": "Point-defense curtain spinning up. Hold missiles.",
  "loc.src.data.enemies.field.line.d3ffb3ff6b16": "Enemy screen deploying. The warden is guarding the pack, not hunting you.",
  "loc.src.data.enemies.field.line.d78e35907345": "A worm works the field. It cannot turn mid-weave — put a rock on the line.",
  "loc.src.data.enemies.field.line.d9c7610b4c5c": "A rail lance charging at standoff. Break its line or close under cover.",
  "loc.src.data.enemies.field.line.eb23c49b37da": "The pack turns as one — the whole swarm burns in together.",
  "loc.src.data.enemies.field.line.fa732d3727f5": "The bruiser is squaring its prow for a committed run. Slip the pass and take the flank.",
  "loc.src.data.enemies.field.line.fc35209ab931": "A pirate hull stalking the lane — it presses, calls the swarm, runs when broken.",
  "loc.src.data.enemies.field.name.132ca7d3be2c": "Reaver Pirate",
