  "loc.src.data.heistmission.field.brief.40b88ebe7f20": "Hold the transfer-yard gate open on its counterweight while the tug walks two sealed crates through.",
  "loc.src.data.heistmission.field.brief.844045d42a62": "A flywheel assembly broke away from the Tethys launcher. Bring it home through the Concord catcher fork.",
  "loc.src.data.heistmission.field.description.180ff4aa389c": "The transfer yard's gate is balanced on a cradle: park the ballast block on it —",
  "loc.src.data.heistmission.field.description.ed83206705e2": "The SP-07 flywheel assembly left the Tethys Surface Launcher off its line and is tumbling",
  "loc.src.data.heistmission.field.summary.0a409651f70b": "Recover a drifting industrial flywheel assembly and deliver it into the Concord catcher fork.",
  "loc.src.data.heistmission.field.summary.41ddef5012f1": "Keep a qualifying mass settled on the cradle; the yard pays per crate delivered.",
  "loc.src.data.heistmission.field.title.71ca1f34363c": "The Counterweight — Yard Watch",
  "loc.src.data.heistmission.field.title.9ad718fd1b5a": "The Third Shift — SP-07 Recovery",
  "loc.src.data.hullburst.field.blurb.81abb95df831": "burns through the hull at the nose: light and medium hulls die, heavies ignite",
  "loc.src.data.hullburst.field.blurb.cf2fcae4054a": "throws hostile hulls at the nose, harder the faster you arrive",
  "loc.src.data.hullburst.field.blurb.d685c5b0b049": "catches a light hull on the nose and carries it; press again to let it go",
