  "loc.src.data.missions.field.objective.3c68f64fc9b2": "Complete the faction intro selected by the Elroy outcome.",
  "loc.src.data.missions.field.objective.4707b181a3d8": "Deploy a drone, then assign the program selected by the Elroy outcome.",
  "loc.src.data.missions.field.objective.85c517084f36": "Contract 47-A: sample the 12.4t mass discrepancy, dock Helios. Payment withheld. Status pending.",
  "loc.src.data.missions.field.objective.9f57d41056c5": "Complete your faction chain: MTS trade runs, SCN patrol clears, or Free Captain smuggling jobs.",
  "loc.src.data.missions.field.objective.cb1842490b2b": "Tow the slag core the long way. Keep it on the line into the yard, or sling it in.",
  "loc.src.data.missions.field.objective.d91eb4227b5e": "The Deep Reach climax: run the blockade, siege the tower, or tow the evidence, then review final dispositions.",
  "loc.src.data.missions.field.objective.e2d2853c449d": "Knock the variance tower — wrecking-ball contract. Swing mass through it, or cut it down.",
  "loc.src.data.missions.field.objective.f9fb80ea944f": "Pull the life pods out under fire. Tow one home, or open a corridor and reel.",
