  "loc.src.data.modules.field.description.0b40182ac3fa": "A polarized scanner gasket tuned to the membrane band. Mirror-echo contacts mark themselves instead of wearing a clean return.",
  "loc.src.data.modules.field.description.2fbf69e332df": "A slow tape for the relay band. Sites that pulse in phase leave a coherence signature in your flight log.",
  "loc.src.data.modules.field.description.3a4f140536f6": "A lattice-tuned responder salvaged from a machine site. Verge instruments read your compliance in half the window.",
  "loc.src.data.modules.field.description.465719bdd7dc": "Electrostatic mesh over the intakes and plate seams. Contaminated sectors stop fouling your hull — and your manifest.",
  "loc.src.data.modules.field.description.4776d3c9ef1a": "A sealed custody drawer rated for living cargo. What is locked in it does not breathe on the manifest.",
  "loc.src.data.modules.field.description.5cd0a744d472": "A hull-resonance mapper that reads the structure under the growth. Entering a colonized field, the host resolves on the chart.",
  "loc.src.data.modules.field.description.5ecd2394d4b5": "A padded field cage for the massline. Release the latch while it is fitted and the animal comes aboard alive.",
  "loc.src.data.modules.field.description.67f5036e8c59": "A rack listener on the relay band. Inside a colonized field it reports how coherent the ecology currently reads.",
  "loc.src.data.modules.field.description.765549e37d36": "A field coil salvaged from a dead pylon. Your beam strikes read as dead matter — the sleepers do not hear you work.",
  "loc.src.data.modules.field.description.b113418edbb4": "A tuned probe for the relay band. Coherent emitters report their broadcast strength instead of a bare contact.",
  "loc.src.data.modules.field.description.b4c3b881765d": "Charge-thrown bait: a burn-flag beacon that reads hotter than your reactor. Predators chase the lie for a minute.",
  "loc.src.data.modules.field.description.b5679786dabe": "A two-pin tap into site memory. Approach a machine site and its last issued directive echoes back through your comms.",
  "loc.src.data.modules.field.description.c6cd09d58cbb": "A burn collar around the plate seams. Docking with it fitted fires one sterilizing pass — fouled hulls berth clean.",
  "loc.src.data.modules.field.description.d22898fec706": "Deep-sector rated filters — a full-bore regeneration stack for pilots who work contaminated space on purpose.",
  "loc.src.data.modules.field.description.d8b535cb2d0f": "Hull plating that damps your drive and mass signature. Animals that hunt heat notice you later — or never.",
  "loc.src.data.modules.field.description.dc38e8890726": "Drop a proximity charge behind your flight path. Pursuers trigger a radial shove; remote detonation still works.",
  "loc.src.data.modules.field.description.dc97ec469948": "Registry-stamped quarantine seals. Stations that would refuse a biological lot instead take it at surrender prices.",
  "loc.src.data.modules.field.description.dd3e8f4a2332": "A Verge-layer decode lattice. Where the machines speak in directive fragments, you read the sentence underneath.",
  "loc.src.data.modules.field.description.e7dca3647f09": "A scanning head retuned for filament-band returns. Biological contacts resolve one classification rung earlier.",
